# A created deck's captured parts are stored and written exactly as the reference produced them, and
# their line endings differ part by part, so each must keep its own bytes (the crate's
# `writing/pptx/create/parts.rs` records the measured mix). The rule is scoped to that directory
# alone — a blanket setting would also rewrite `assets/docgen/document-kit.js`, whose digest is part
# of the reference writer's identity.
/document-engine/assets/pptx-create/** -text
